    "text": "The following data are for the decomposition of ammonium nitrite in aqueous solution :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/C2gSp2yRHw6YU0u2ydT16ZtNdhOkIxS7eFDlTyw7eaI.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nThe order of reaction is:",
